title: Media
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: party_affairs
view-if: media_timer <= 0
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; media_timer += 6;
card-image: img/nd.jpg
#subtitle: Setting the direction for our newspapers and radio.

= Media

There are many kinds of media the <span style="color: [+ linke_color +];">**Left**</span> uses to communicate to its voter base. We could use the them for various purposes...

- @trad_media: Focus on traditional media like newspapers and electoral posters.
- @social_media: Build up our social media apparatus.
- @ideological
- @return: We should not do anything with media at the moment.
- @easy_discard
- @cancel_advisor_action

@trad_media
on-arrival: newspapers += 1; social_media -= 0.2; urban_linke += ((10+newspapers)/15)*(1-dissent); east_linke += ((10+newspapers)/15)*(1-dissent);

We have decided to focus on traditional forms of media.

@social_media
on-arrival: social_media += 1; newspapers -= 0.2; youth_linke += ((13+social_media)/15)*(1-dissent); urban_linke += ((2+social_media)/10)*(1-dissent);

We have invested more in social media campaigns and advertisements, in an attempt to connect with younger voters.

@ideological
title: We will have vibrant ideological debate within our media.
subtitle: There will be space for all factions to air their views.
on-arrival: oldleft_dissent -= 6; beweli_dissent -= 6; emali_dissent -= 6; pragmatist_dissent -= 6;

This has been our media course historically, and it has successfully paved over the many tensions in our party.
